%% Week 11 · Fault Tree Analysis. TOP event: a customer cannot place an order (POST /api/orders ≠ 201
%% within 2 s). Gates: OR = any child causes the parent; AND = all children needed.
%% Green = basic event mitigated in Week 11 (pattern in brackets) · red = the real incident PM-W11-01
%% · grey = accepted / out of scope. Probabilities are rough per-month estimates for the lab cluster.
flowchart TB
    TOP{{"TOP · order cannot be placed<br/>POST /api/orders ≠ 201 within 2 s"}}
    G1(("OR"))
    TOP --- G1

    EDGE["E1 · edge path down<br/>Traefik / gateway / overload"]
    ORD["E2 · orders cannot answer"]
    CAT["E3 · price lookup fails<br/>AND no fallback"]
    DB["E4 · orders DB write fails"]
    G1 --- EDGE & ORD & CAT & DB

    G2(("OR")); EDGE --- G2
    B1["traffic burst / retry storm<br/>[rate limit 429 · ADR-W11-04]"]:::ok
    B2["gateway pod lost<br/>[replicas · PDB]"]:::acc
    G2 --- B1 & B2

    G3(("OR")); ORD --- G3
    B3["all orders pods down<br/>[2 replicas · topology spread]"]:::acc
    B4["workload cert expired → mTLS reset<br/>PM-W11-01 · p ≈ 1/month on a laptop<br/>[TTL 168 h · IstioWorkloadCertExpired alert]"]:::inc
    B5["threads/sockets exhausted by slow catalog<br/>[timeouts · bulkhead connectionPool]"]:::ok
    G3 --- B3 & B4 & B5

    G4(("AND")); CAT --- G4
    C1(("OR")); G4 --- C1
    NOFB(("OR")); G4 --- NOFB
    B6["catalog slow (latency ≫ 1 s)<br/>E1 chaos: 3000 ms"]:::ok
    B7["catalog unreachable / partition<br/>E2 chaos"]:::ok
    B8["catalog pod killed<br/>E3 chaos [retry + outlier detection]"]:::ok
    B9["catalog DB / its cert down"]:::acc
    C1 --- B6 & B7 & B8 & B9
    F1["product not in orders' cache<br/>(cold pod, new product) → 503 + Retry-After"]:::acc
    F2["cache older than 10 min"]:::acc
    NOFB --- F1 & F2

    G5(("OR")); DB --- G5
    B10["postgres pod down<br/>(single replica StatefulSet)"]:::acc
    B11["postgres cert expired<br/>PM-W11-01"]:::inc
    G5 --- B10 & B11

    classDef ok fill:#e3f4ea,stroke:#2a9d8f,color:#1b4332
    classDef inc fill:#fde2e4,stroke:#e63946,color:#6a040f
